<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kwong Yik 6-mth net up 34.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kwong Yik 6-mth net up 34.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  51.02    vs	37.94</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 16.0     vs	12.0</p>
<p>    Net income		 176.66    vs     138.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    85.32    vs	64.26</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    10.0     vs	nil</p>
<p>    Loans and advances   6,349.25    vs   5,367.79</p>
<p>    Deposits		 5,957.23    vs   4,272.32</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Kwong Yik Bank Bhd. It is 75 percent owned by Malayan Banking Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
